              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A coin? (मुद्रा, mudrā.) A post office? (पत्रालयः, patrālayaḥ.) A letter? (लेखः, lekhaḥ.) A book? (ग्रन्थः, granthaḥ.) A picture? (चित्रम्, citram.) A musical instrument? (वाद्यम्, vādyam.) A veena? (वीणा, vīṇā.) A cloth? (पट्टः, paṭṭaḥ.) A jewel? (रत्नम्, ratnam.) Gold? (सुवर्णम्, suvarṇam.) Silver? (रजतम्, rajatam.) Glass? (काचः, kācaḥ.) A cart? (शकटम्, śakaṭam.) A pot? (भाण्डम्, bhāṇḍam.) A cot? (खट्वा, khaṭvā.) A seat? (पीठम्, pīṭham.) A bicycle? (द्विचक्रिका, dvicakrikā.) A vehicle? (यानम्, yānam.) A ship? (नौयानम्, nauyānam.) A train? (धूमयानम्, dhūmayānam.) A cloth? (पटः, paṭaḥ.) A lake? (सरोवरः, sarovaraḥ.) A riverbank? (नदीतीरम्, nadītīram.) A cuckoo? (कोकिलः, kokilaḥ.) A sparrow? (चाटकः, cāṭakaḥ.)"
